ks.</li><li>Low Power Consumption – Passive copper design reduces energy usage and heat.</li><li>Aruba Certified – Guaranteed compatibility with Aruba switches and network devices.</li><li>Hot-Pluggable SFP+ Interface – Easy installation without system downtime.</li><li>Cost-Effective Solution – More affordable than fiber optic transceivers and patch cables.</li><li>Durable Construction – High-quality shielding minimizes interference and ensures long-lasting performance.</li><li>Standards Compliant – Meets SFP+ MSA and IEEE 802.3ae 10GBASE-CX1 standards for interoperability.</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module\">Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">700৳</span> \n                                <span class=\"price-old\">800৳</span> \n            